&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryEstabelec DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryEstabelec :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} where
                                 {&TableName}.cod-estab   >= c-cod-estabel-ini and 
                                 {&TableName}.cod-estab   <= c-cod-estabel-fim NO-LOCK.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryMain DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryMain :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} 
    FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK INDEXED-REPOSITION.
   RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

